const introParagraphs = [
  "<strong>When an appliance fails in West Hollywood, our techs at Same Day Appliance Repair trace it to a handful of patterns: Sub-Zero 650 refrigerators with a failed evaporator fan and iced-over coils, Bosch dishwashers that won't drain on a blocked drain pump and cracked impeller, LG washer-dryer combos overheating and shutting off on a blocked vent duct that trips the thermal fuse, and Thermador ranges with igniters stuck sparking and a sticking gas valve. We dispatch same-day across Robertson Blvd, Norma Triangle, and the Sunset Strip. $89 residential diagnostic, waived with repair. BHGS #A49573, EPA 608 Universal certified (#1346255700410), BBB Accredited.</strong>",
